Dear Ms. Whitfield,

I understand your frustration. To summarize what has been done: staff checked the 12th floor after each of your reports to the front desk; a courtesy notice was sent to the neighboring apartment; a building-wide smoke-free reminder went out on October 14; and maintenance replaced a stuck exhaust damper in your bathroom on October 28.

We have not been able to confirm the source of the odor. I would like to meet with you next week to review next steps. Please let me know what time works.

